; smf-format0 — three tracks merged into one.
;
; A format 1 file: a conductor (name, meter, tempo, a marker at tick 96),
; a lead track and a bass track on another channel. `(write :format0
; true)` merges every track by tick, stable, the first track's events
; first at a tie — and tick 96 carries a tie on purpose, so the sort's
; stability is in the hash.
(read)
(roundtrip)
(write :format0 true)
